{"ID":"20240513083004-rxl2rtb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083004-rxl2rtb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083004-rxl2rtb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513174223-fivxo96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513174223-fivxo96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513174223-fivxo96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:448,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:448\u0026#125;","title":"317","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115211"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513174223-fivxo96","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 625px;","id":"20240513174223-fivxo96","updated":"20240515115211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：07/05/2008"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"228-3 P, E "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69/胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"23/05/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：皮膚紅癢"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 頭身：非常癢，仍然是晚上癢甚，皮膚很粗糙。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 汗：在外工作會流汗，汗出較不癢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 飲食：口渴喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 睡眠：睡時身溫正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 二便：大便一日一行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 其它：每天睡前會洗澡，而且洗熱水澡會更舒服，皮膚不癢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 稍浮"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：淡黃濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷：用表藥去癢，發汗後如仍癢，且未改善則止藥。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃三錢、杏仁五錢、薏仁五錢、甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" →麻杏薏甘湯方，解表袪肌濕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"連翹三錢、銀花二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→止皮癢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃芩三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→清皮毛之熱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 前方欲清肝解毒未去癢，服用仍癢，表示病不在血分在氣分，故用發表藥來治。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 之前我們用了很多藥來解你的肝毒，但你還是癢，這一次我們用一些藥來把皮表的毒解掉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 我們要用麻杏薏甘湯要先問口渴，如果沒有口渴，我們麻黃、杏仁等量，若有口渴則杏仁加重，舌苔黃則甘草不用炙的而用生的。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 如果我們這藥有作用，你會覺得皮膚每天是冷的。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"備註： "}]}]}]}]}